{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07731","headline":"送王七尉松滋得阳台云 · 孟浩然","name":"送王七尉松滋得阳台云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见巫山神女作行云，霏红沓翠晓氛氲。\n婵娟流入楚王梦，倏忽还随零雨分。\n空中飞去复飞来，朝朝暮暮下阳台。\n愁君此去爲仙尉，便逐行云去不回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07731.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07731","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}